{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/extras/2aabf7ac62d28ed909e87fe8e04d04f7.avif?t=1770474068\" width=840 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Strange Lights</strong> - is a short indie horror game in the &quot;<u>Walking Simulator</u>&quot; genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;<u>From a local resident's story:</u></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>It was night. I was sleeping and suddenly I heard a dull noise, as if something exploded. The windows shook. I saw a flash, so strong, as if day had come, but everything was a strange color... It seems blue...&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a journalist, whose career urgently needs a breakthrough story...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local residents living on the outskirts of the forest say that they often hear strange sounds from the forest, as if some kind of animal, but it does not sound like any animal, and they also often see some strange flashes in the direction of this forest... They said that the flashes and sounds come from the side of the old factory, which has been closed for 50 years...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/extras/71cf71629b8d460e5e7cb5795f3cbd3b.poster.avif?t=1770474068\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/extras/71cf71629b8d460e5e7cb5795f3cbd3b.webm?t=1770474068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/extras/71cf71629b8d460e5e7cb5795f3cbd3b.mp4?t=1770474068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's where you'll go...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You took a camera with you to record all these strange phenomena that the locals are talking about and perhaps release the best report in your life...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/extras/d8fb26439faa7368ceb4bf832ef13855.poster.avif?t=1770474068\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/extras/d8fb26439faa7368ceb4bf832ef13855.webm?t=1770474068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/extras/d8fb26439faa7368ceb4bf832ef13855.mp4?t=1770474068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Realistic graphics in VHS style.</u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Creepy atmosphere of something unknown.</u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Incredible sound design that will immerse you in the game.</u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Scary moments that will give you goosebumps...</u></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Arrival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823950/d4e2cd592ecaa64fec516be78c257ffd92d539d5.jpg"},{"name":"Old Factory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823950/49c8ecac7a64e7ba31fb0977a80653bb4782272b.jpg"},{"name":"Strange Lights","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823950/c4d6747735df713ee49cd8b4ced04d6aaadfff55.jpg"},{"name":"The Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823950/5e5a0016a15f6faa5d908d9544250285522d5ef1.jpg"},{"name":"The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3823950/b0fc90259f5a3e53aaea4905a3e1c81ad02dbae0.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823950?t=1770474068","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/a6b1a956a0ffe09f02e8ef73684fae84f4c74cb6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770474068","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/b3d3191eeb77a507610a04689a79ed6574e9a4d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770474068","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/b3d3191eeb77a507610a04689a79ed6574e9a4d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770474068","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/extras/2aabf7ac62d28ed909e87fe8e04d04f7.avif?t=1770474068\" width=840 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Strange Lights</strong> - is a short indie horror game in the &quot;<u>Walking Simulator</u>&quot; genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;<u>From a local resident's story:</u></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>It was night. I was sleeping and suddenly I heard a dull noise, as if something exploded. The windows shook. I saw a flash, so strong, as if day had come, but everything was a strange color... It seems blue...&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a journalist, whose career urgently needs a breakthrough story...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local residents living on the outskirts of the forest say that they often hear strange sounds from the forest, as if some kind of animal, but it does not sound like any animal, and they also often see some strange flashes in the direction of this forest... They said that the flashes and sounds come from the side of the old factory, which has been closed for 50 years...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/extras/71cf71629b8d460e5e7cb5795f3cbd3b.poster.avif?t=1770474068\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/extras/71cf71629b8d460e5e7cb5795f3cbd3b.webm?t=1770474068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/extras/71cf71629b8d460e5e7cb5795f3cbd3b.mp4?t=1770474068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's where you'll go...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You took a camera with you to record all these strange phenomena that the locals are talking about and perhaps release the best report in your life...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823950/extras/d8fb26439faa7368ceb4bf832ef13855.poster.avif?t=1770474068\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shar